                <pb facs="0375" n="275" xml:id="pg275"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">856d.6363/10: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in the Netherlands</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Phillips</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-08-18"><hi rendition="#italic">August 18,
                            1920</hi></date>[<hi rendition="#italic">—1
                    p.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>535. Your telegram 212 August 12, 6 p.m.</p>
                <p>You may defer answer to Foreign Office until you receive views of Department
                    which will probably await further information from East Indies and from
                    Secretary of Interior.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Colby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
